# Ray uploads the working_dir as a runtime-env package, capped at 512 MiB.
# This directory had grown to 1.5 GiB of scratch (jax compile caches, wandb
# runs, campaign outputs), so EVERY --ray-measure job was failing at init with
# RuntimeEnvSetupError before running a single episode. None of the below is
# code; src/ and tests/ are deliberately NOT excluded.
.jaxcache_perf2/
wandb/
campaign_exp/
.claude/
campaign_aoj_sub1/
decode2_out/
decode3_out/
decode4_out/
decode5_out/
decode6_out/
*.out
